  "body": "This draft records a completed street review and prepares one bounded Sauganash signoff trial. **This head changes only STATUS and ROADMAP; generators, form flags, assets and workflows are unchanged. No native build is armed.** Both complete raw document archives remain exact prefixes.\n\nActual published `e803db79d3` was reviewed from Lake Street\u2019s real sidewalk at the native 1.68 m eye, flight off and FOV55. Both look directions reached both genuine brick stacks through the native GPU picker; the focused capture properly exited0 with all children reaped and zero page/console/network/server errors. All693 critical bindings and5895 published files stayed unchanged. Root directly reviewed both frames. The earlier external `walk`/`sidewalk` fixture failure remains RED in the evidence.\n\nThe remaining concrete trial is a Hotel-only opt-in shared-ridge join and a reconstructed0.60 m square shaft width, keeping shaft heights/plain heads, count/stations, main dimensions, existing site, dates and canonical cameras. The3.75 m ridge separation is a current-model contract finding, **not proof of the exact historic intersection**. Cap lips alone are not a new task. Independent static/pure peer approval covers the unapplied proposal; it does not qualify native geometry or an image match.\n\n[Actual street review and honest failure history](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/tree/de48d0b43c5df6fd9fae32143eab0c8ae2f98f1b/evidence/sauganash-2026-11-04/finite-street-review-and-unapplied-join-width-prep/) \u00b7 [Refined V2 proposal and independent peer](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/blob/b46dc28277df09824a871edfbebdbcc21c5317f2/evidence/sauganash-2026-11-04/finite-join-width-prep-v2-peer-reviewed/RECOVERY-V2.md)\n\nStill required before ordinary dev merge: full-dataset Covers/SourceUse/parameter/confidence owners; separately approved source/native execution; genuine23default+2Tremont-variant rebuild and actual24control MASTER comparison before WEB reuse; controlled source comparisons and current published target review; required source/preflight/runtime gates and exact final-head eight-part check plus aggregate. The source stage is still pending; no sparse-checkout full-data PASS or new native PASS is claimed. Original T-2383 remains owned and incomplete, the current Hotel comparison remains **DIFFERS**, and no photo followup is created.\n",
